+  is observed by the caller.
+
+## Requirement: Preserve multiple teardown failures
+
+On Python versions with exception-group support, Flask SHALL raise the
+collected teardown failures in an exception group. On older supported Python
+versions, Flask MAY raise the first collected teardown failure.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- teardown-lifecycle: D-17 requires cleanup continuation and deferred teardown
